\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces The verified deception loop. A session enters through the behavioral classifier (Chrollo), which routes it to a per-class deception policy. The retrieval engine (Don) grounds the policy in CTI; the fiction graph binds every host fact; the generator drafts under the binding; the verifier checks the draft against the graph before serving. Dashed paths are failure paths: verification failure falls back to deterministic transcripts, and content flagged \textsc  {require} pauses at the human-in-the-loop gate.}}{8}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:architecture}{{2}{8}{The verified deception loop. A session enters through the behavioral classifier (Chrollo), which routes it to a per-class deception policy. The retrieval engine (Don) grounds the policy in CTI; the fiction graph binds every host fact; the generator drafts under the binding; the verifier checks the draft against the graph before serving. Dashed paths are failure paths: verification failure falls back to deterministic transcripts, and content flagged \textsc {require} pauses at the human-in-the-loop gate}{figure.2}{}}
