\newlabel{tab:two-channel}{{8}{18}{Two-channel metrics of the verified RAGIN pipeline (generator: gateway default (glm-5.3-flash-free)). Served text is shown raw (the echo-crediting rubric) and echo-guarded (post-audit); the guarded column is canonical. The deception surface deliberately answers CTI-style questions with machine transcripts, not technique essays; the intelligence value lives in the analysis channel. Guarded numbers are computed on the audited surface, proven row-matched to this run by pre-guard score equality on all 218 rows (\texttt {cti\_manual\_audit.json})}{table.8}{}}
\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {9}{\ignorespaces External baselines on the 218-query workload (generator: deepseek-v4-flash-free for all LLM arms). \textbf  {All scores are served-text channel under the raw (pre-guard) rubric}---the deception quality an attacker experiences. Paired per-row deltas are scorer-invariant: the verified loop serves byte-identical strings to the no-verifier arm on all 218 rows (paired delta 0.000), and the host-fiction layer adds cross-session consistency at exactly zero quality cost (paired per-row delta 0.000). Absolute levels on fallback-heavy runs shift under the echo guard (Table~\ref {tab:two-channel}); the grounding and consistency contrasts do not.}}{18}{table.9}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:baseline-served-text}{{9}{18}{External baselines on the 218-query workload (generator: deepseek-v4-flash-free for all LLM arms). \textbf {All scores are served-text channel under the raw (pre-guard) rubric}---the deception quality an attacker experiences. Paired per-row deltas are scorer-invariant: the verified loop serves byte-identical strings to the no-verifier arm on all 218 rows (paired delta 0.000), and the host-fiction layer adds cross-session consistency at exactly zero quality cost (paired per-row delta 0.000). Absolute levels on fallback-heavy runs shift under the echo guard (Table~\ref {tab:two-channel}); the grounding and consistency contrasts do not}{table.9}{}}
